{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Worn By The Forgotten DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo version of Worn By The Forgotten allows players to experience the beginning of the journey \u2014 the first journey for earning the first mask, includes two fully playable levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will explore the initial areas of the forgotten land, encounter early puzzles, and experience the core mechanics such as mask collection, card-based abilities, and environmental interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version of the game will include four distinct journeys to gather the lost masks, each with its own unique environments, story progression, and additional cards and abilities to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A card-based adventure game where every step \u2014 and every card you play \u2014 shapes your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131360/extras/f2e717b4725faf204512f4e67993e770.avif?t=1761976090\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Worn By The Forgotten, you are Worn, chosen by a divine mask to traverse a broken world. Explore handcrafted levels, gather fragments of forgotten masks, and build your own deck of abilities to overcome diverse challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cards are more than attacks. Use them to fight enemies, sneak past patrols, create diversions, or even manipulate the environment. Every level offers multiple approaches, and the way you combine movement, cards, and limited resources determines your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recovering masks unlocks entirely new decks, giving you fresh tools and strategies for the trials ahead. Between missions, customize your deck, upgrade your abilities, and prepare for the journey to regain the faces of the forgotten world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Ability Bestowed on Worn : Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and set your deck with unique cards tied to each mask you unlock. Each card has different and unique powers, that can be used to maneuver through difficult situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131360/extras/dea2d09b4946285c26702b9e20e503e7.poster.avif?t=1761976090\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131360/extras/dea2d09b4946285c26702b9e20e503e7.webm?t=1761976090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131360/extras/dea2d09b4946285c26702b9e20e503e7.mp4?t=1761976090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore and Adventure in a Faceless World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move freely through handcrafted stages with multiple solutions. Find out about the world that lost it\u2019s face. Every character and person you meet will give you different answers and stories. Engage with them, and enjoy a more immersive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131360/extras/859f99bb3eb556050be5b17390fe051f.poster.avif?t=1761976090\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131360/extras/859f99bb3eb556050be5b17390fe051f.webm?t=1761976090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131360/extras/859f99bb3eb556050be5b17390fe051f.mp4?t=1761976090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weave through Difficult levels with Dynamic Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using Cards, or quietly moving through enemies. The choice is yours! Creative card use make every encounter unique. The levels are not easy, and your choices and actions should be spent wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131360/extras/0f286af2cbac7e945faa8b61ebc77d40.poster.avif?t=1761976090\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131360/extras/0f286af2cbac7e945faa8b61ebc77d40.webm?t=1761976090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131360/extras/0f286af2cbac7e945faa8b61ebc77d40.mp4?t=1761976090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find out about the Old World through Totems and Shrines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the levels, you will meet different Totems, that act as a switch that can control the puzzles laid out for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131360/extras/8170e4021616e4309cf3544adf7a5c9a.poster.avif?t=1761976090\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131360/extras/8170e4021616e4309cf3544adf7a5c9a.webm?t=1761976090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131360/extras/8170e4021616e4309cf3544adf7a5c9a.mp4?t=1761976090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, you can encounter the gods through the mask you wear, and they offer various choices that can help your journey through shrines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131360/extras/57951adf288fc9a8e6f28ddd9e0631f1.poster.avif?t=1761976090\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131360/extras/57951adf288fc9a8e6f28ddd9e0631f1.webm?t=1761976090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131360/extras/57951adf288fc9a8e6f28ddd9e0631f1.mp4?t=1761976090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4131360?t=1761976090","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4131360?t=1761976090","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131360/ba7c80a586301c50e24fa11fa3523ab802d8fb99/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761976090","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131360/ba7c80a586301c50e24fa11fa3523ab802d8fb99/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761976090","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Worn By The Forgotten DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo version of Worn By The Forgotten allows players to experience the beginning of the journey \u2014 the first journey for earning 